        <reference anchor="RFC3602" target="https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3602" quoteTitle="true" derivedAnchor="RFC3602">
          <front>
            <title>The AES-CBC Cipher Algorithm and Its Use with IPsec</title>
