        <reference anchor="RFC4106" target="https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc4106" quoteTitle="true" derivedAnchor="RFC4106">
          <front>
            <title>The Use of Galois/Counter Mode (GCM) in IPsec Encapsulating Security Payload (ESP)</title>
